#. <CLT 4>…まずはモノクマファイルで、
#. 状況を確認してみよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>First I'd better check the Monokuma File...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>被害者は、山田一二三と石丸清多夏。
#. 両名とも致命傷は<CLT><CLT 3>頭部の殴打<CLT><CLT 4>。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"The victims were Hifumi Yamada and Kiyotaka Ishimaru.\n"
"The cause of death for each was a <CLT><CLT 3>blow to the head<CLT><CLT 4>.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それぞれ、<CLT><CLT 3>似たような凶器<CLT><CLT 4>で、
#. 殺されたものと思われる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"It is thought that they were both killed with a\n"
"<CLT><CLT 3>similar weapon<CLT><CLT 4>.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …って、これだけ？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's it?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに妙だな…
#. 情報量が今までと比べて少な過ぎる。
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it's pretty strange. We got way less information\n"
"this time than before."
msgstr ""

#. …問題ないでしょう。そもそも今回の事件は、
#. わたくし達の目の前で次々と起きたのです。
msgctxt "0007 | CELES"
msgid ""
"That is no problem. After all, the events of this case\n"
"unfolded before our very eyes."
msgstr ""

#. モノクマファイルよりも、
#. わたくし達の方が事件に詳しいはずですわ。
msgctxt "0008 | CELES"
msgid ""
"We should know more about what happened than the\n"
"Monokuma File could, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. それは、そうかもしれんが…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. それと、もう１つ気になっている事がある…
msgctxt "0011 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "There's something else that's bothering me..."
msgstr ""

#. 消えたままの、もう１人の事だ。
msgctxt "0012 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Someone else has been missing for quite a while..."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さん…の事だよね？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you talking about Kyoko?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、あいつには、
#. セレスや山田襲撃の際のアリバイがあるが…
msgctxt "0014 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Without a doubt, she has an alibi for when Celeste and\n"
"Hifumi were attacked."
msgstr ""

#. だったら、単独犯ではなく、
#. あいつが<CLT 3>犯人の共犯をしていた<CLT>可能性ならどうだ？
msgctxt "0015 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But what if the killer wasn't acting alone? What if\n"
"they had...<CLT 3>an accomplice<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. きょ、共犯！？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "An accomplice!?"
msgstr ""

#. きょ、共犯！？
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "An accomplice!?"
msgstr ""

#. …何しに来のですか？
msgctxt "0018 | CELES"
msgid "...What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#. 邪険にしないでよ。
#. せっかく、質問に答えに来てやったんだからさ！
msgctxt "0019 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Don't be rude! I'm here to answer your question!"
msgstr ""

#. 質問…？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What question...?"
msgstr ""

#. 共犯の話をしてたでしょ？
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You're talking about accomplices, right?"
msgstr ""

#. その説明は前にもしたと思うんだけど…
#. そう、あれは１回目の学級裁判の時…
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure I explained it before, didn't I?\n"
"During the first class trial!"
msgstr ""

#. ついでに、そこのヌイグルミに聞いておきたいんだが、
#. 共犯者が存在した場合は、そいつもクロになるのか？
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Speaking of which, I'd like to ask the bear...if there\n"
"*is* an accomplice, do they also become \"blackened\"?"
msgstr ""

#. では、答えましょう！！
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So you ask, and so I shall answer!"
msgstr ""

#. 殺人の際、共犯者を味方につける事は可能ですが、
#. “卒業”出来るのは、実行犯であるクロ１名のみです。
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Each murder is allowed to have an accomplice, but only\n"
"the one who does the killing will get to graduate."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、いくら殺人を手伝ったところで、
#. 共犯者は得しないのね…
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So in other words, two people can work together, but\n"
"one of them has no chance of profiting from it..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、共犯者ってのはなさそうだな…
msgctxt "0027 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Then there's no way anyone would work together,\n"
"right...?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり…共犯者になったところで、
#. お得感ゼロパーセントな訳ですよ！
msgctxt "0028 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So basically...you can be an accomplice if you want,\n"
"but there's no gratification in it!"
msgstr ""

#. では、今回も共犯者の可能性は
#. ないという事か？
msgctxt "0029 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So are you saying nobody worked together this time,\n"
"either?"
msgstr ""

#. いやいや、そこまでは答えられませんけどね。
#. オマエラの自由な発想の妨げにもなっちゃうし！
msgctxt "0030 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Sorry, can't answer that! It would obstruct the free\n"
"exchange of information between you guys."
msgstr ""

#. ただ、忘れないで欲しいのは、
#. いくら殺人を手伝ったところで…
msgctxt "0031 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I just want to make sure you don't forget—no matter\n"
"how much you might assist in a murder..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>卒業出来るクロはただ１人<CLT>って事。
#. 共犯者は何も得しません！
msgctxt "0032 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...<CLT 3>only one blackened can graduate<CLT>. An accomplice\n"
"gets NOTHING!"
msgstr ""

#. では、今回の学級裁判で俺達が指摘するのは、
#. いつものように殺人を犯したクロ１人だけなんだな？
msgctxt "0033 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then we only need to figure out who that one blackened\n"
"is that did the killing, right? Just like normal?"
msgstr ""

#. …じゃあ、この際だから、
#. ここでハッキリと決めておきましょうか。
msgctxt "0034 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, let me take this opportunity to clarify\n"
"the whole shebang."
msgstr ""

#. 今回の学級裁判で、
#. オマエラが指摘するのは…
msgctxt "0035 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "In this class trial, what you need to determine is..."
msgstr ""

#. この殺人計画を作り上げ、それを実行した、
#. <CLT 3>“真のクロただ１人のみ”<CLT>です！
msgctxt "0036 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...the <CLT 3>one true blackened<CLT> who devised the murder\n"
"plot and put it into action!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>真のクロ…ただ１人のみ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The true blackened...? So just one person?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さてと、説明はこれくらいにしておきましょうか。
msgctxt "0038 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "That's enough for explainifyin'!"
msgstr ""

#. 後は、クロとオマエラ全員のガチンコ勝負！！
#. お互いに頑張ってね～！！
msgctxt "0039 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Now it's down to the final battle between all of you,\n"
"and the blackened! Good luck to all the contestants!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>クロは１人だけ…共犯者は何も得しない…
#. となると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So there can only be one blackened. An accomplice\n"
"wouldn't benefit...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、霧切さんが事件に関係している可能性は
#. 考えられないんじゃ…
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Then I can't see any way Kyoko would be connected to\n"
"this case, after all."
msgstr ""

#. …そうかもしれんな。
msgctxt "0042 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You may be right..."
msgstr ""

#. それならそれで…
#. 霧切ちゃんはどこ行っちゃったんだろ…？
msgctxt "0043 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "If that's true then...Kyoko, where are you?"
msgstr ""

#. …事件に関係ないならそれでいい。
#. ならば、我らは捜査に集中するとしよう。
msgctxt "0044 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"As long as she's not connected to the case, it doesn't\n"
"matter. Let's get back to the investigation."
msgstr ""

#. 捜査…ですか…
#. 犯人は葉隠君で間違いないでしょうけど…
msgctxt "0045 | CELES"
msgid "I have absolutely no doubt that Hiro is responsible."
msgstr ""

#. 一応、捜査だけはしておいた方がいいでしょうね。
msgctxt "0046 | CELES"
msgid ""
"But for the time being, I suppose it can't hurt to\n"
"pursue further information."
msgstr ""

#. それとさ…念の為だけど、
#. あの人も容疑者に入れておいた方がよくない？
msgctxt "0047 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You know...don't you think we should consider a\n"
"certain someone a suspect, just in case?"
msgstr ""

#. あの…ジェノサイダー翔って殺人鬼…
msgctxt "0048 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm talking about the murderous fiend...Genocide Jack!"
msgstr ""

#. なにそれ！　ぶったまげ！！
msgctxt "0049 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wha—!? I'm offended!"
msgstr ""

#. キャアッ！！
msgctxt "0050 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Kyah!?"
msgstr ""

#. お前…いつの間に…
msgctxt "0051 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You... When did you—?"
msgstr ""

#. 捜しちゃったわよ、白夜様！
#. 目が覚めたらいなくなってるんだもん！
msgctxt "0052 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I've been looking all over for you, Master! When I\n"
"woke up, you were nowhere to be found!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0053 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …それはそうと、そこの巨乳スイマー！！
msgctxt "0054 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Anyway! You there, milk sack swimmer girl!"
msgstr ""

#. 巨乳スイマーって…
msgctxt "0055 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Milk sack...?"
msgstr ""

#. なんで、アタシが容疑者なのよッ！
msgctxt "0056 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Why do I gotta be a suspect!?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…あんたは殺人鬼だし…
msgctxt "0057 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Well, I mean...you *are* a serial killer."
msgstr ""

#. そんな理由で、容疑者レギュラー化！？
#. アタシにはアリバイもあるのに！
msgctxt "0058 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"So what, I'm like a special guest suspect every time!?\n"
"I have an alibi, you know!"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、そいつにはアリバイがあったな。
msgctxt "0059 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "She's right about that..."
msgstr ""

#. 山田の悲鳴を聞いた時は、
#. そいつも一緒だったはずだ…
msgctxt "0060 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "When we heard Hifumi scream, she was with me."
msgstr ""

#. それと…２人の死体が消えた時も、
#. そいつは物理準備室で気を失ったままだった…
msgctxt "0061 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And when the bodies disappeared, she was still lying\n"
"unconscious in the equipment room."
msgstr ""

#. 現場にいた石丸の死体運搬はともかく、
#. 保健室の山田の死体運搬は、そいつには不可能だ。
msgctxt "0062 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Plus, Taka's body aside, I can't imagine any way she\n"
"would have been able to move Hifumi's body."
msgstr ""

#. それとさ、アタシって意外に計算深いんだよ。
#. 顔バレしてる状況で、人殺しなんかしないって！
msgctxt "0063 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Besides, I calculate every move I make! I'm not gonna\n"
"kill someone when everyone knows what I look like!"
msgstr ""

#. だてに、殺人鬼やってる訳じゃないんだからねッ！！
msgctxt "0064 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "They don't call me the murderous fiend for nothing!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事で、いばんないでよ！！
msgctxt "0065 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's not the kind of thing you should be bragging\n"
"about!"
msgstr ""

#. …ところで、現場の見張りはどうしましょう？
#. また死体を隠されると厄介ですわよ。
msgctxt "0066 | CELES"
msgid ""
"On another topic, should we post a guard by the bodies\n"
"like before? We can't have them disappearing again..."
msgstr ""

#. ならば、我と朝日奈がやろう。
#. 朝日奈よ、それで構わないな…？
msgctxt "0067 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hina and I can handle that. You don't mind, do you\n"
"Hina?"
msgstr ""

#. うん。どうせ私じゃ、
#. 捜査の役には立てないだろうし…
msgctxt "0068 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Sure. I'd be totally useless on the investigation,\n"
"anyway..."
msgstr ""

#. …決定だな。
#. では、いい加減に始めるぞ。
msgctxt "0069 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then that's that. Let's begin."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても…
#. 今回の事件って、なんだか妙だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This whole thing is so strange...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなにはアリバイがあって…
#. そのお陰で、容疑者も絞られてるんだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All but one of us has an alibi, so figuring out who\n"
"did it should be obvious, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気のせいかもしれないけど、
#. 今回は…そんな簡単な犯人当てじゃない気がする…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe it's just me, but I don't think it's going to be\n"
"as straightforward as it seems.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>モノクマファイル３<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Monokuma File #3<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …十神クン。
#. やっぱり、犯人は葉隠クンなのかな？
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Byakuya... Do you think Hiro really did it?"
msgstr ""

#. …それ以外に考えられまい。
msgctxt "0076 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I don't see how anyone could think otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. 殺人や死体消失などの一連の事件が起きた際、
#. 俺達全員にはアリバイがあるんだ。
msgctxt "0077 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"When the attacks and murders and disappearances all\n"
"happened, every one of us had an alibi."
msgstr ""

#. それと、山田が死に際に残した言葉も…
msgctxt "0078 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And the last thing Hifumi said when he died..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>やすひろ<CLT>…だったよね？
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah...he said <CLT 3>Hiro's<CLT> name."
msgstr ""

#. …となると、犯人は葉隠以外には考えられんだろう。
msgctxt "0080 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then there is no room to suspect anyone else."
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、犯人が葉隠クンだとしても…
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Okay, but if he did do it..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼はどうして、<CLT 3>あんな変な衣裳<CLT>で、
#. 顔を隠したりしたのかな？
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Why would he hide his identity with <CLT 3>that weird\n"
"costume<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. どんな衣装であろうとも、
#. 姿を隠せばバレないとでも思ったんじゃないか？
msgctxt "0083 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Maybe he thought that no matter what happened, he'd be\n"
"safe as long as his face was covered."
msgstr ""

#. …あいつは世紀末的なバカだからな。
msgctxt "0084 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Because he's the fool of the century, you see."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かにバカだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, he *is* kinda dumb...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…って、そんな理由で片付けちゃっていいのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But do you really think that's enough to explain it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこに…大きな手掛かりが
#. あるような気がするんだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I feel like there's a clue hiding in there\n"
"somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それで終わりか？　
#. お前が気になっているのはそれだけか？
msgctxt "0088 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And is that it? That's all that bothers you about the\n"
"case?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、他にもあるよ…
#. 気になってる事…
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, no... There are a few other things."
msgstr ""

#. …犯人が死体を隠した理由とか。
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Like, why did the killer try to hide the bodies?"
msgstr ""

#. 死体が見つからなければ捜査も出来ない…
#. そう思って隠したんだろう。
msgctxt "0091 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"They probably figured that if we couldn't find the\n"
"bodies, we couldn't complete our investigation."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その割には、
#. 簡単に死体が見つかったよね？
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But if that's the case, we found the bodies pretty\n"
"easily, didn't we?"
msgstr ""

#. それも…
#. 犯人が間抜けだったと理由付ける他ないだろう…
msgctxt "0093 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Again, it comes back to the fact that the culprit was\n"
"a moron."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…それでいいのかな…？
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is that really all there is to it...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0095 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. それと、もう１つ気になってるのは…
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The other thing that bothers me is..."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は、どうして<CLT 3>２人も殺したのか<CLT>って事なんだ。
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...why'd they bother killing <CLT 3>two people<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. …何？
msgctxt "0098 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr ""

#. だってさ、この学園生活のルールでは、
#. <CLT 3>殺人を犯して逃げ延びれば<CLT>、卒業出来るんだよね？
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because all the rule says is, <CLT 3>if you can kill someone\n"
"and get away with it<CLT>, you graduate. Right?"
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら、犯人は、他の人に犯行を悟られない事を
#. １番に考えると思うんだ。
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So if you're the killer, your number one priority is\n"
"not getting caught."
msgstr ""

#. ２件の殺人を犯すって事は…
#. それだけ手掛かりが増えるはずなのに…
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But killing two people means more clues, more chances\n"
"you'll get found out."
msgstr ""

#. 待てよ。ひょっとすると…
msgctxt "0102 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hold on. Perhaps..."
msgstr ""

#. そうか…そういう事か…
msgctxt "0103 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I see... So that's what that means."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうしたの…？
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-Is everything okay...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0105 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 馴れ馴れしく話し掛けるな…
msgctxt "0106 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Don't talk to me as if we're friends."
msgstr ""

#. えっ、いきなり？
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What's with the attitude?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、礼は言っておこう。
msgctxt "0108 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "But...you have my appreciation."
msgstr ""

#. お陰で楽しくなりそうだ。
msgctxt "0109 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, I might have some fun with this after\n"
"all."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それだけ言い残して、
#. 十神クンは美術倉庫から去っていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>His mysterious words hung in the air as he left the\n"
"repository.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何か…わかったみたいな口ぶりだったけど…
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He talked as if...he'd figured something out."
msgstr ""

#. それなら教えてくれてもいいのにな…
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But if he did, would it have killed him to tell me\n"
"what it was?"
msgstr ""

#. あのさ、苗木。
#. 実は、ちょっと気になる事があるんだよね。
msgctxt "0113 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, um...Makoto? I've been thinking about something."
msgstr ""

#. この美術倉庫に関してなんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0114 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It's about the repository..."
msgstr ""

#. …美術倉庫がどうかしたの？
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. 山田と石丸の死体が消えた後さ、
#. みんなで手分けして捜索するって流れになったじゃん？
msgctxt "0116 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"After Hifumi and Taka's bodies disappeared, we split\n"
"up to look around, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 私、怖くなっちゃったから、
#. さくらちゃんと一緒にいたんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0117 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I was really scared, so me and Sakura stuck together."
msgstr ""

#. その時、私達は真っ先に
#. この美術室を調べに来てたんだよね。
msgctxt "0118 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And we came right to the repository to, y'know, look\n"
"around."
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、その時は<CLT 3>美術倉庫に鍵が掛かってて<CLT>、
#. 中に入れなかったんだよ…
msgctxt "0119 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But when we got here, <CLT 3>the repository was locked<CLT>. We\n"
"couldn't get inside..."
msgstr ""

#. …鍵が掛かってた？
msgctxt "0120 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was locked...?"
msgstr ""

#. ここに来たのは、捜索を始めた直後だったから、
#. 他の誰かに先を越されたはずないんだけど…
msgctxt "0121 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And we came here as soon as the search started, so\n"
"there's no way someone coulda beat us here..."
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら、誰が鍵を掛けたんだろうね？
#. しかも、その鍵も今は開いてるし…
msgctxt "0122 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So if that's true, then...who locked it? And why is it\n"
"unlocked now?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…気になるね…
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I wonder the same thing..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体の捜索を始めた直後には閉まっていた鍵が、
#. 今は開いている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door was locked when the search for the bodies\n"
"began, but now it's wide open...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か秘密がありそうだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There might be some secret lurking in there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それを知る為にも、
#. この部屋から出てみてもいいかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0126 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I'll probably have to leave this area to figure it\n"
"out...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術倉庫側からしか掛けられない鍵か…
#. ちょっと引っ掛かるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door can only be locked from inside the\n"
"repository. Which makes me wonder...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さん達は、死体が消えた後の捜索で、
#. その時、ドアに鍵が掛かっている事を確認している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and Sakura both confirmed that the door was\n"
"locked after the search for the bodies began.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、そのドアの鍵は、
#. 美術倉庫の側からしか掛けられない仕組み…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the door is designed so that it can only be locked\n"
"from inside the repository.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…こういう事だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんが調べに来た時は、
#. 倉庫の中に人がいて、鍵が掛かっていたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When Hina checked it, someone had already gone in the\n"
"repository and locked the door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その後、その人物が鍵を開けた事で、
#. ここに入れるようになった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0134 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When they were done, they unlocked it and left. Which\n"
"is why it's unlocked now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とすると、その誰かって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So that certain someone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんが言うには、
#. 他の誰かに先を越された可能性はないらしいから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina claims that there's no way someone could have\n"
"beaten them to the repository...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>姿を消したままの犯人…もしくは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Was it the killer, who's still roaming free? Or...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>被害者…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0138 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...was it one of the victims?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>美術倉庫のドア<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0139 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Repository Door<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、気になるなぁ。
msgctxt "0140 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "This whole situation really does bother me..."
msgstr ""

#. 山田と石丸の死体が消えた後さ、
#. みんなで手分けして捜索するって流れになったじゃん？
msgctxt "0141 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"After Hifumi and Taka's bodies disappeared, we split\n"
"up to look around, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 私、怖くなっちゃったから、
#. さくらちゃんと一緒にいたんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0142 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I was really scared, so me and Sakura stuck together."
msgstr ""

#. その時、私達は真っ先に
#. この美術室を調べに来てたんだよね。
msgctxt "0143 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And we came right to the repository to, y'know, look\n"
"around."
msgstr ""

#. でもさ、その時は<CLT 3>美術倉庫に鍵が掛かってて<CLT>、
#. 中に入れなかったんだよ…
msgctxt "0144 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But when we got here, <CLT 3>the repository was locked<CLT>. We\n"
"couldn't get inside..."
msgstr ""

#. ここに来たのは、捜索を始めた直後だったから、
#. 他の誰かに先を越されたはずはないんだけど…
msgctxt "0145 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And we came here as soon as the search started, so\n"
"there's no way someone coulda beat us here..."
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら、誰が鍵を掛けたんだろうね？
#. しかも、その鍵も今は開いてるし…
msgctxt "0146 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So if that's true, then...who locked it? And why is it\n"
"unlocked now?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…気になるね…
msgctxt "0147 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I wonder the same thing..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体の捜索を始めた直後には閉まっていた鍵が、
#. 今は開いている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0148 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door was locked when the search for the bodies\n"
"began, but now it's wide open...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そこには、何か秘密がありそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0149 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There must be some hidden clue in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今回の事件では、色んな事があった。
#. いや、色んな事があり過ぎた…と言うべきか。
msgctxt "0150 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There are many aspects to the incident this time.\n"
"*Too* many, to be honest..."
msgstr ""

#. …思い出すという意味でも、
#. 事件を振り返ってみるのもいいかもしれんぞ。
msgctxt "0151 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Considering that, it may be good to look back on\n"
"everything that's happened."
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0152 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0153 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. 我が、その手伝いをしてやろうか…？
msgctxt "0154 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Would you like my help?"
msgstr ""

#. …そうだね、じゃあ一緒に振り返ってみようか。
msgctxt "0155 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, let's look back on things."
msgstr ""

#. 今朝、食堂に集まったのは、
#. <CLT 3>我<CLT>と<CLT 3>苗木<CLT>と<CLT 3>朝日奈<CLT>と<CLT 3>霧切<CLT>の４人だけだったな。
msgctxt "0156 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"This morning, only four of us met up at the dining\n"
"hall—<CLT 3>Hina<CLT>, <CLT 3>Kyoko<CLT>, <CLT 3>you<CLT>, and <CLT 3>myself<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. いくら待っても他の者が来ないので、
#. 我らは、来ない連中の捜索を開始する事にしたんだ。
msgctxt "0157 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We waited for the others, but nobody showed up. So we\n"
"decided to go look for them."
msgstr ""

#. その捜索を始めたのが、<CLT 3>８時頃<CLT>の事だったな…
msgctxt "0158 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "It was around <CLT 3>8 o'clock<CLT> when we began our search."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、手分けした直後から、
#. 霧切さんがいなくなったんだよね…
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And soon after we split up, Kyoko disappeared..."
msgstr ""

#. その後、朝日奈が<CLT 3>３階の娯楽室<CLT>で<CLT 3>セレス<CLT>を見つけ、
#. 慌てて苗木や我を集めたのだ。
msgctxt "0160 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"After that, Hina found <CLT 3>Celeste<CLT> in the <CLT 3>rec room, on\n"
"the 3rd floor<CLT>, then quickly came and got you and me."
msgstr ""

#. セレスさんの話によると、彼女は不審者に襲われてから
#. １時間ほど気を失っていたらしいよ。
msgctxt "0161 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"According to Celeste, she was attacked by a suspicious\n"
"individual and lay unconscious for about an hour."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、彼女が襲われたのは、
#. ボクらに発見される１時間くらい前…
msgctxt "0162 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In other words, she was attacked an hour before we\n"
"found her."
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>７時過ぎ<CLT>って事になるね。
msgctxt "0163 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Meaning, <CLT 3>just after 7 o'clock<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. その際、セレスが撮った画像により、
#. その不審者が妙なコスプレをしている事がわかった。
msgctxt "0164 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Based on the picture Celeste took, we discovered her\n"
"attacker was dressed in a strange costume."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>ジャスティスロボ<CLT>…だったな…
msgctxt "0165 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "It was...<CLT 3>Robo Justice<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. しかも、そのジャスティスロボに、
#. <CLT 3>山田が連れ去られている<CLT>という事実も判明したのだ。
msgctxt "0166 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It also became clear that this Robo Justice had\n"
"<CLT 3>dragged Hifumi away<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 不審者の捜索を始めた我らは、
#. 腐川や十神と合流した後…
msgctxt "0167 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"After meeting up with Toko and Byakuya, we began\n"
"searching for the costumed assailant."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>２階の図書室<CLT>で、<CLT 3>傷を負った山田<CLT>を発見した。
msgctxt "0168 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We found an <CLT 3>injured Hifumi<CLT> in the <CLT 3>library, on the\n"
"2nd floor<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 我らは、傷付いた山田を<CLT 3>１階の保健室<CLT>に連れていき、
#. 再び不審者の捜索を再開したんだ。
msgctxt "0169 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We took him down to the <CLT 3>nurse's office, on the 1st\n"
"floor<CLT>, then resumed our search."
msgstr ""

#. そして、保健室から出た直後…
msgctxt "0170 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "But not long after leaving the nurse's office..."
msgstr ""

#. …ッ！？
msgctxt "0171 | CELES"
msgid "...!?"
msgstr ""

#. …どうした？
msgctxt "0172 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What's wrong...?"
msgstr ""

#. 影です…あの階段の上で影が動きました！
msgctxt "0173 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I saw a shadow! Something moving around at the top of\n"
"the stairs!"
msgstr ""

#. セレスさんの目撃証言を元に、ボクらは<CLT 3>２階<CLT>へ行き、
#. そこから手分けして捜索する事になった。
msgctxt "0174 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Based on Celeste's claims, we went back up to the <CLT 3>2nd\n"
"floor<CLT>, where we split up and began searching."
msgstr ""

#. そうしたら、その直後…
msgctxt "0175 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then, right after that..."
msgstr ""

#. セレスが叫び声を上げた。
#. 今度は<CLT 3>３階<CLT>で不審者の姿を見つけたのだ。
msgctxt "0176 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Celeste screamed. This time she had apparently seen\n"
"the suspect on the <CLT 3>3rd floor<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. あいつの叫び声を聞き、
#. 我らもすぐに<CLT 3>３階<CLT>へと向かった。
msgctxt "0177 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hearing her screams, we quickly made our way to the\n"
"<CLT 3>3rd floor<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. セレスちゃん、どうしたの！？
msgctxt "0178 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Celeste! What's wrong!?"
msgstr ""

#. お前にしては、やけに大げさな叫び声だったな…
msgctxt "0179 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That was a rather...intense scream for someone like\n"
"you."
msgstr ""

#. 見つけたのです…例のコスプレ不審者を…
msgctxt "0180 | CELES"
msgid "I saw him! The strange costumed man...!"
msgstr ""

#. わたくしが叫び声を上げたら、
#. 逃げていきました。
msgctxt "0181 | CELES"
msgid "He ran off as soon as I screamed..."
msgstr ""

#. 階段を背にしたわたくしに対して、
#. 左側の廊下の奥を曲がっていきましたわ。
msgctxt "0182 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I was blocking the stairs, so he headed further down\n"
"into the hallway and disappeared...!"
msgstr ""

#. そして、その直後…
#. 今度は…
msgctxt "0183 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "And then..."
msgstr ""

#. ギニャアアアアアアアーッ！！
msgctxt "0184 | NO NAME"
msgid "Ungyaaaaaahhh!!!"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ！？
msgctxt "0185 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. な、何ッ…！？
msgctxt "0186 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh-What was that!?"
msgstr ""

#. 下の階から聞えましたわね。
#. という事は、今の悲鳴は…！
msgctxt "0187 | CELES"
msgid "That came from downstairs! It must have been..."
msgstr ""

#. 保健室にいる…山田クンの…？
msgctxt "0188 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hifumi! He's in the nurse's office!"
msgstr ""

#. マズイよ！　急いで戻ろう！！
msgctxt "0189 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This is bad! Come on, we have to go back!"
msgstr ""

#. そこで、ボクらは二手に分かれる事になったんだ。
msgctxt "0190 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "At that point, we decided to split up into two groups."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>ボク<CLT>と<CLT 3>セレスさん<CLT>と<CLT 3>朝日奈さん<CLT>は、
#. １階の保健室に戻り…
msgctxt "0191 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Celeste<CLT>, <CLT 3>Hina<CLT>, and <CLT 3>I<CLT> went back to the nurse's\n"
"office."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>大神さん<CLT>と<CLT 3>十神クン<CLT>と<CLT 3>腐川さん<CLT>が、
#. ３階で不審者を追ったんだよね。
msgctxt "0192 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, <CLT 3>you<CLT>, <CLT 3>Byakuya<CLT>, and <CLT 3>Toko<CLT> pursued the\n"
"suspect up on the 3rd floor."
msgstr ""

#. そして、ボクは戻った保健室で…
msgctxt "0193 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And when we got back to the nurse's office..."
msgstr ""

#. 山田クンの死体を発見したんだ。
msgctxt "0194 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...we found Hifumi's corpse."
msgstr ""

#. ボクはそこで…
#. <CLT 3>死体発見アナウンス<CLT>が流れるのを聞いたんだよ。
msgctxt "0195 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Which is also when we heard the <CLT 3>body discovery\n"
"announcement<CLT> play."
msgstr ""

#. その事を伝える為、セレスさんと朝日奈さんを残して、
#. ボクは再び３階へと戻った。
msgctxt "0196 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I left Celeste and Hina alone and headed back to the\n"
"3rd floor to tell the others what had happened."
msgstr ""

#. だが、その時…我らは<CLT 3>３階の物理準備室<CLT>で、
#. 石丸の死体を発見したところだった。
msgctxt "0197 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But at that same time, we had discovered Taka's body\n"
"in the <CLT 3>equipment room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 山田と石丸の死体が発見されたのは、
#. <CLT 3>ほぼ同時<CLT>だったはずだ…
msgctxt "0198 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Which means Hifumi and Taka's bodies were discovered\n"
"<CLT 3>right around the same time<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 我も、石丸の死体を発見した直後、
#. あのアナウンスが流れるのを聞いたからな。
msgctxt "0199 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Because I remember hearing the body discovery\n"
"announcement play right after finding Taka."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、ボクは大神さんと十神クンに、
#. 山田クンが殺されていた事を伝えたんだよね？
msgctxt "0200 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And that's when I showed up and told you and Byakuya\n"
"that Hifumi had been killed, right?"
msgstr ""

#. それで、<CLT 3>ボク<CLT>と<CLT 3>大神さん<CLT>と<CLT 3>十神クン<CLT>は、
#. 一緒に保健室に向かう事になったんだ。
msgctxt "0201 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Then <CLT 3>you<CLT>, <CLT 3>me<CLT>, and <CLT 3>Byakuya<CLT> all headed back to the\n"
"nurse's office..."
msgstr ""

#. 気絶した腐川さんを置いてね…
msgctxt "0202 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...leaving behind Toko, who had fainted."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、物理室から出た直後…
msgctxt "0203 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But as soon as we left the physics lab..."
msgstr ""

#. 遅れてやって来たセレスさんから、
#. ボクらは驚くべき話を聞く事になったんだ。
msgctxt "0204 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...we ran into Celeste, who'd just arrived to tell us\n"
"something very unusual."
msgstr ""

#. 山田君の死体が消えてしまったのです！
msgctxt "0205 | CELES"
msgid "Hifumi's body has disappeared!"
msgstr ""

#. 急いで戻った保健室には、
#. もう山田クンの死体はなかった…
msgctxt "0206 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"We hurried back to the nurse's office, to discover\n"
"that his corpse was, in fact, gone."
msgstr ""

#. その直後、気絶した腐川を置いてきた事を思い出し、
#. 我らは、再び<CLT 3>物理準備室<CLT>へと戻ったのだが…
msgctxt "0207 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then we remembered we had abandoned the unconscious\n"
"Toko, and rushed back to the <CLT 3>equipment room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. まさか…これは…？
msgctxt "0208 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "This can't be happening..."
msgstr ""

#. 我らは…夢でも見ているのか？
msgctxt "0209 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Are we hallucinating all this or something?"
msgstr ""

#. 今度は、石丸クンの死体も消えてしまったんだ…
msgctxt "0210 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This time, Taka's body had disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. ボクらは慌てて、
#. 消えた２人の死体の捜索に取り掛かった。
msgctxt "0211 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So from there, we began our search for both of the\n"
"missing bodies."
msgstr ""

#. そして、しばらくすると…
msgctxt "0212 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And after some time..."
msgstr ""

#. セレスが死体を見つけたと聞き、
#. 我らは<CLT 3>美術倉庫<CLT>へと向かったのだったな…
msgctxt "0213 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Celeste told us she'd found the bodies, and we all\n"
"headed to the <CLT 3>repository<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、消えていた２人の死体を“再発見”したんだ…
msgctxt "0214 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And there we rediscovered the two bodies that had\n"
"apparently vanished."
msgstr ""

#. …こんな流れだったよね。
msgctxt "0215 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...And that brings us up to now."
msgstr ""

#. こうやって振り返ってみると、
#. 本当に、色々な事が起きたものだ…
msgctxt "0216 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Looking back, things have certainly been very\n"
"active..."
msgstr ""

#. また事件を振り返りたくなったら我に言え。
#. いつでも協力してやるぞ…
msgctxt "0217 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you want to look back at the case again, just let\n"
"me know. I'm fine anytime."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今はこんな物を調べている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0218 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"don't have time to be staring at it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. 今はこんな物を調べている場合じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0219 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... I don't have time to be\n"
"staring at it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう…動かなくなってしまった石丸クン…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0220 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Taka... He'll never move again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマファイルによると、
#. 石丸クンの致命傷は<CLT><CLT 3>頭部の殴打<CLT><CLT 4>だったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0221 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>According to the Monokuma File, Taka died from <CLT><CLT 3>a blow\n"
"to the head<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最初に死体が発見された物理準備室…
#. あそこにあった<CLT><CLT 3>ジャスティスハンマー４号<CLT><CLT 4>が凶器かな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0222 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We found <CLT><CLT 3>Justice Hammer 4<CLT><CLT 4> near his body in the\n"
"equipment room. Is that what was used to kill him...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それと、石丸クンの死体の下に、
#. ビニールシートが敷かれているけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0223 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And there's a tarp laid out under his body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、石丸クンの死体を運ぶ際に、
#. 犯人が使った物なのかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0224 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did the killer use this to move Taka's body?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>運ぶ際に、血の跡を残さないように…って。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0225 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That way, there wouldn't be any blood left behind\n"
"while the body was moved...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>ビニールシート<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0226 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Blue Tarp<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>取っ手がないタイプの台車だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0227 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a dolly. It doesn't have a handle...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>昔、美術室とかで見た事あるな。
#. 彫像とかを乗せておくのに使われてたっけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0228 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I saw this in the art room before. I guess it's used\n"
"to move statues around.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>使い勝手は悪いけど、腰を曲げて姿勢を低くすれば、
#. 動かす事自体には問題なさそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0229 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's kinda awkward, but if you bend down, it's not too\n"
"hard to use.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ…？
#. でも、この台車…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0230 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? But wait...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>物理準備室<CLT><CLT 4>で石丸クンの死体を見つけた時にあった、
#. あの台車じゃないのか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0231 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wasn't this in the <CLT><CLT 3>equipment room<CLT><CLT 4> when we found\n"
"Taka's body?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、この台車のタイヤ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0232 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And look at the wheel...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>血痕が付着している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0233 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bloodstain on it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>物理準備室<CLT><CLT 4>から<CLT><CLT 3>美術倉庫<CLT><CLT 4>に移動した台車…
#. そのタイヤに付着した<CLT><CLT 3>血痕<CLT><CLT 4>…<CLT>
msgctxt "0234 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So there's <CLT><CLT 3>blood<CLT><CLT 4> on the wheel of the dolly that was\n"
"moved from the <CLT><CLT 3>equipment room<CLT><CLT 4> to the <CLT><CLT 3>repository<CLT><CLT 4>...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これらが意味する事って…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0235 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's the explanation for that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>美術倉庫の台車<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0236 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Repository Dolly<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>冷たくなった山田クンの巨体が…
#. 床に転がっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0237 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hifumi's big, cold body is laying on the floor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても…本当に巨体だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0238 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>His...*really* big body.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな大きな山田クンを…
#. 犯人は一体どうやって運んだんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0239 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, how on Earth was the killer able to move\n"
"someone so big?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、最初に死体が発見された<CLT><CLT 3>保健室は１階<CLT><CLT 4>で、
#. この<CLT><CLT 3>美術倉庫は３階<CLT><CLT 4>なんだぞ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0240 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From <CLT><CLT 3>the nurse's office<CLT><CLT 4> where he was discovered to\n"
"here, the <CLT><CLT 3>repository<CLT><CLT 4>...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この巨体を１階から３階まで…
#. しかも、ボクらの目に付かないように運ぶなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0241 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All the way from the 1st floor to the 3rd... And all\n"
"without anyone noticing it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一体どうやって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0242 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How the hell...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0243 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>…駄目だ、全然思い付かない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0244 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...It's no good. I just don't get it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とりあえず、この件は後で考えるとして、
#. 先に山田クンの死体の調査を済ませるか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0245 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can think about it later. For now, I have to finish\n"
"investigating Hifumi himself.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、山田クンの致命傷も頭部の殴打だったよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0246 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I remember correctly, Hifumi's fatal injury was\n"
"also a blow to the head.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、保健室に落ちてた<CLT><CLT 3>ジャスティスハンマー３号<CLT><CLT 4>で
#. やられたんだろうけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0247 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Probably from <CLT><CLT 3>Justice Hammer 3<CLT><CLT 4>, which was laying on\n"
"the floor in the nurse's office...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ、待てよ…？
msgctxt "0248 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Wait..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この死体…何かおかしいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0249 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something's...off about his body.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだ、この妙な違和感は…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0250 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why am I getting this feeling...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何かが…違う……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0251 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something's...different.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>保健室で見た山田クンの死体と、
#. ここにある山田クンの死体の何かが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0252 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something about Hifumi's body in the nurse's office,\n"
"versus his body right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…そうだ、メガネだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0253 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...That's it! His glasses!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>保健室にあった死体のメガネは、
#. 確かに、血で汚れていたはずなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0254 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When his body was in the nurse's office, his glasses\n"
"were covered with blood.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…メガネがキレイになっている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0255 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But now...they're completely clean.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かが…山田クンのメガネを拭いたって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0256 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean...someone wiped his glasses off?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、誰が…なんの為に…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0257 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But who would do that? And why...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>山田のメガネ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0258 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Hifumi's Glasses<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>冷たくなった山田クンの巨体が…
#. 床に転がっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0259 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hifumi's big, cold body is laying on the floor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても、犯人はどうやって、
#. この山田クンの死体を運んだんだろう？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0260 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But how did the killer manage to move it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、最初に死体が発見された<CLT><CLT 3>保健室は１階<CLT><CLT 4>で、
#. この<CLT><CLT 3>美術倉庫は３階<CLT><CLT 4>なんだぞ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0261 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From <CLT><CLT 3>the nurse's office<CLT><CLT 4> where he was discovered to\n"
"here, the <CLT><CLT 3>repository<CLT><CLT 4>...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この巨体を１階から３階まで…
#. しかもボクらの目に付かないように運ぶなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0262 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All the way from the 1st floor to the 3rd... And all\n"
"without anyone noticing it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その方法は…
#. いっこうに思い付きそうにない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0263 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I just can't imagine how it was done.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それと、山田クンの致命傷は
#. 頭部の殴打だったよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0264 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Further, Hifumi died from a blow to the head.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、保健室に落ちてた<CLT><CLT 3>ジャスティスハンマー３号<CLT><CLT 4>で
#. やられたんだろうな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0265 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to assume it came from <CLT><CLT 3>Justice Hammer 3<CLT><CLT 4>,\n"
"which we found in the nurse's office.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0266 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>保健室にあった死体のメガネは、
#. 血で汚れていたはずなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0267 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When we found his body in the nurse's office, his\n"
"glasses were covered in blood.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…今はキレイになっている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0268 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But now they're spotless...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かが山田クンのメガネを拭いたって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0269 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean someone wiped his glasses clean?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、誰が…なんの為に…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0270 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But who would do that? And why...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁には大小様々なハンマーが掛けられている。
#. けど…いくつか歯抜けになってるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0271 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are hammers of all different sizes hanging on\n"
"the wall. Although some are more like mallets...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>歯抜け……？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0272 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mallets...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、このハンマーを元にして、
#. ジャスティスハンマーが作られたのかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0273 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could the Justice Hammers have been designed...using\n"
"these as a model?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても、ここのハンマーは、
#. どれも、かなり使い込まれているみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0274 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Either way, all the hammers here have obviously seen a\n"
"lot of use.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>石の破片や粉なんかが、
#. あちこちに付着している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0275 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're all covered in debris and chalky stone\n"
"powder...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0276 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか…このハンマーだけ水に濡れてて、
#. 汚れてないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0277 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For some reason...this one hammer isn't dirty at all.\n"
"And it's...wet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かが、このハンマーを
#. <CLT><CLT 3>水で洗ったり<CLT><CLT 4>したって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0278 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did someone <CLT><CLT 3>wash<CLT><CLT 4> it recently...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>洗われたハンマー<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0279 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Spotless Hammer<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁には大小様々なハンマーが掛けられている。
#. けど…いくつか歯抜けになってる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0280 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are hammers of all different sizes hanging on\n"
"the wall. Although some are more like mallets...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、このハンマーを元にして、
#. ジャスティスハンマーが作られたのかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0281 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could the Justice Hammers have been designed...using\n"
"these as a model?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても、ここのハンマーは、
#. どれもかなり使い込まれているみたいだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0282 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Either way, all the hammers here have obviously seen a\n"
"lot of use.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>石の破片や粉なんかが、
#. あちこちに付着している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0283 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're all covered in debris and chalky stone\n"
"powder...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも…
msgctxt "0284 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか…このハンマーだけ水に濡れてて、
#. 汚れてないんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0285 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For some reason this one hammer isn't dirty at all.\n"
"And it's also wet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かがこのハンマーを
#. <CLT><CLT 3>水で洗った<CLT><CLT 4>って事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0286 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did someone <CLT><CLT 3>wash<CLT><CLT 4> it recently...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この部屋の出口は１つ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0287 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one way in and out of this room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんが言っていた、
#. 鍵の掛かっていたドアだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0288 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Through the door that Hina said was locked before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ドアには鍵が掛かるみたいだけど、
#. 鍵を掛けられるのは、こっちの倉庫側だけみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0289 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's true that there's a lock on the door, but it can\n"
"only be locked from inside the repository.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どう見ても、
#. 美術室側からは鍵を掛けられそうにない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0290 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see any way to lock it from in the art room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…
msgctxt "0291 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術倉庫側からしか掛けられない鍵か…
#. ちょっと引っ掛かるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0292 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door can only be locked from inside the\n"
"repository. Which makes me wonder...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さん達は、死体が消えた後の捜索で、
#. ドアに鍵が掛かっている事を確認している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0293 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and Sakura confirmed that the door was locked\n"
"after we started looking for the missing bodies.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、そのドアの鍵は、
#. 美術倉庫の側からしか掛けられない仕組み…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0294 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the door is designed so that it can only be locked\n"
"from inside the repository.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…こういう事だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0295 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんが調べに来た時は、
#. 倉庫の中に人がいて鍵が掛かっていたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0296 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When Hina checked it, someone had already gone in the\n"
"repository and locked the door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その後、その人物が鍵を開けた事で、
#. ここに入れるようになった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0297 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When they were done, they unlocked it and left. Which\n"
"is why it's unlocked now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、朝日奈さんが言うには、
#. 他の誰かに先を越された可能性はないらしいから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0298 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But Hina claims that there's no way someone could have\n"
"beaten them to the repository...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とすると、その誰かって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0299 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So that certain someone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>美術倉庫のドア<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0300 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Repository Door<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0301 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0302 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>美術倉庫から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0303 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the repository?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この部屋の出口は１つ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0304 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one way in and out of this room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんが言っていた、
#. 鍵の掛かっていたドアだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0305 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Through the door that Hina said was locked before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かにドアには鍵が掛かるみたいだけど、
#. 鍵を掛けられるのは、こっちの倉庫側だけみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0306 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's definitely a lock on the door, but it can only\n"
"be locked from inside the repository.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どう見ても、
#. 美術室側からは鍵を掛けられそうにない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0307 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't see any way to lock it from in the art room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うーん…
msgctxt "0308 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術倉庫側からしか掛けられない鍵か…
#. ちょっと引っ掛かるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0309 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The door can only be locked from inside the\n"
"repository. Which makes me wonder...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さん達は、死体が消えた後の捜索で、
#. ドアに鍵が掛かっている事を確認している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0310 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hina and Sakura confirmed that the door was locked\n"
"after we started looking for the missing bodies.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、そのドアの鍵は、
#. 美術倉庫の側からしか掛けられない仕組み…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0311 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the door is designed so that it can only be locked\n"
"from inside the repository.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…こういう事だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0312 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんが調べに来た時は、
#. 倉庫の中に人がいて鍵が掛かっていたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0313 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When Hina checked it, someone had already gone in the\n"
"repository and locked the door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その後、その人物が鍵を開けた事で、
#. ここに入れるようになった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0314 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When they were done, they unlocked it and left. Which\n"
"is why it's unlocked now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、朝日奈さんが言うには、
#. 他の誰かに先を越された可能性はないらしいから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0315 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But Hina claims that there's no way someone could have\n"
"beaten them to the repository...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とすると、その誰かって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0316 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So that certain someone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>美術倉庫のドア<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0317 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Repository Door<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ、調べなきゃいけない事があるはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0318 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I should probably look around here a little more...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
